// ndn-town-odd.cpp
// ODD-scenario engine (highway / rural / urban): loads RSU positions,
// failure schedule, vehicle mobility trace, and precomputed RSU<->vehicle
// candidate contact windows from files (generated by generate_rsu_config.py
// and precompute_candidate_links.py). Implements LIVE VCF: real PIT-expiry
// detection triggers real-time vehicle scoring (speed/heading/CS capacity)
// to pick a mule, instead of replaying a pre-scripted CSV plan. This is a
// separate file from ndn-town-final.cpp (the original 12-RSU/1217-vehicle
// dataset), which is left untouched.

